=1x+(2)y?$" 13194139538541 17592186045443 true] [17592186670666 1072 #uuid "1c183240-5cb2-5523-9f74-95fbf751d6a2" 13194139538541 17592186045443 true] [17592186670666 1074 "We have to sketch the slope field at the points $(0,1)$,$(-2,0)$,$(2,-1)$.\n\nTo sketch the slope field at the given points, we substitute their coordinates into the right-hand side of the differential equation.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & {\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}|}_{(0,1)}=1(0)+(2)(1)=2, \\\\  & {\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}|}_{(-2,0)}=1(-2)+(2)(0)=-2, \\\\  & {\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}|}_{(2,-1)}=1(2)+(2)(-1)=0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSetting up our points and drawing our line segments, we get the following diagram.\n\n![](images/bf/bf2a18117030301e91784f141d5601a9971f1c6902b2ea6236f2f6b1773f53dd.png)" 13194139538541 17592186045443 true] [17592186670667 1080 "images/20/20e196260d4d38071108e0dbb55879348386b1eb2b502fa3b6b4423f0e367339.png" 13194139538541 17592186045443 true] [17592186670667 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045497 13194139538541 17592186045443 true] [17592186670667 1083 #uuid "2275f5fa-bafb-572f-b6e7-d370b905f9ea" 13194139538541 17592186045443 true] [17592186670668 1080 "images/bf/bf2a18117030301e91784f141d5601a9971f1c6902b2ea6236f2f6b1773f53dd.png" 13194139538541 17592186045443 true] [17592186670668 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045497 13194139538541 17592186045443 true] [17592186670668 1083 #uuid "2671a4fc-1fbc-5996-a738-9b8b5cce8b0d" 13194139538541 17592186045443 true] [17592186670669 1080 "images/f3/f3e940bbe3cf1a82d47a401fef015f4970fab7016f5e82c3bbed5b254251937b.png" 13194139538541 17592186045443 true] [17592186670669 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045497 13194139538541 17592186045443 true] [17592186670669 1083 #uuid "26df92e3-988b-5df6-ba53-422e333c817f" 13194139538541 17592186045443 true] [17592186670670 1080 "images/1d/1dd1a2bade9c53b136f6f66e3b3affe033a51c25dee9eb800412f81ab63c68f1.png" 13194139538541 17592186045443 true] [17592186670670 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045497 13194139538541 175921860